:: StoryStylesheet [stylesheet]
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=BIZ+UDMincho:wght@400;700&display=swap');

/* your typefaces, embedded so they also work in Twine's Play/Test */
@font-face { font-family: 'Reenie Beanie'; src: url(data:font/woff2;base64,) format('woff2'); }
@font-face { font-family: 'Aurora Pro'; src: url(data:font/otf;base64,); }
@font-face { font-family: 'DK Jambo'; src: url(data:font/otf;base64,); }
@font-face { font-family: 'Stay With Me'; src: url(data:font/otf;base64,); }
@font-face { font-family: 'Extra Blur'; src: url(data:font/ttf;base64,); }
@font-face { font-family: 'Megalomania X'; src: url(data:font/ttf;base64,); }

/* ---------- base ---------- */
/* only the game's own typefaces: no browser or Harlowe defaults */
html, body, tw-icon { font-family: 'BIZ UDMincho'; }
tw-story {
  --bg: none;
  --ov: linear-gradient(rgba(12, 10, 18, 0.35), rgba(12, 10, 18, 0.55));
  background-color: #0d0c12;
  background-image: var(--ov), var(--bg);
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
  background-attachment: fixed;
  color: #fbf7f1;
  font-family: 'BIZ UDMincho';
  font-size: 20px;
  line-height: 1.75;
}
/* a solid, dark reading panel: the photo stays visible around it, the text stays crisp */
tw-passage {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 6vh auto;
  padding: 30px 36px;
  background: rgba(11, 9, 16, 0.88);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
  border-radius: 14px;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
  backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
}
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  tw-story { font-size: 18px; }
  tw-passage { margin: 2vh 12px; padding: 22px 18px; }
}
/* choices: a clear pink bar, in the same typeface as the story */
tw-link, .enchantment-link {
  display: inline-block; color: #ff9cc0; font-family: 'BIZ UDMincho'; font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.35;
  margin: 3px 0; padding: 6px 14px; border-left: 3px solid #ff7aa8; background: rgba(255, 122, 168, 0.09); border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;
}
tw-link:hover, .enchantment-link:hover { color: #ffffff; background: rgba(255, 122, 168, 0.22); }
tw-link.visited { color: #ff9cc0; }   /* Harlowe paints visited links purple by default */

/* ---------- time of day ---------- */
tw-story[tags~="day"]   { --ov: linear-gradient(rgba(20, 16, 12, 0.22), rgba(20, 16, 12, 0.42)); }
tw-story[tags~="night"] { --ov: linear-gradient(rgba(4, 6, 24, 0.55), rgba(4, 6, 24, 0.72)); }
tw-story[tags~="rain"]  { --ov: repeating-linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(200,210,230,0.05) 0 2px, transparent 2px 9px), linear-gradient(rgba(30, 34, 44, 0.92), rgba(12, 14, 20, 0.96)); }

/* ---------- backgrounds (photos in img/) ---------- */
tw-story[tags~="bg-gallery"]         { --bg: url("img/gallery.jpg"), url(data:image/jpeg;base64,); }
tw-story[tags~="bg-library"]         { --bg: url("img/library.jpg"), url(data:image/jpeg;base64,); }
tw-story[tags~="bg-cafe"]            { --bg: url("img/cafe.jpg"), url(data:image/jpeg;base64,); }
tw-story[tags~="bg-lounge"]          { --bg: url("img/lounge.jpg"), url(data:image/jpeg;base64,); }
tw-story[tags~="bg-classroom"]       { --bg: url("img/classroom.jpg"), url(data:image/jpeg;base64,); }
tw-story[tags~="bg-lab"]             { --bg: url("img/lab.jpg"), url(data:image/jpeg;base64,); }
tw-story[tags~="bg-vending"]         { --bg: url("img/vending.jpg"), url(data:image/jpeg;base64,); }
tw-story[tags~="bg-bench"]           { --bg: url("img/bench.jpg"), url(data:image/jpeg;base64,); }
tw-story[tags~="bg-stairwell"]       { --bg: url("img/stairwell.jpg"), url(data:image/jpeg;base64,); }
tw-story[tags~="bg-hall-red"]        { --bg: url("img/hall-red.jpg"), url(data:image/jpeg;base64,); }
tw-story[tags~="bg-hall-posters"]    { --bg: url("img/hall-posters.jpg"), url(data:image/jpeg;base64,); }
tw-story[tags~="bg-hall-brick"]      { --bg: url("img/hall-brick.jpg"), url(data:image/jpeg;base64,); }
tw-story[tags~="bg-fountain"]        { --bg: url("img/fountain.jpg"), url(data:image/jpeg;base64,); }
tw-story[tags~="bg-stairs-yellow"]   { --bg: url("img/stairs-yellow.jpg"), url(data:image/jpeg;base64,); }
/* rooms: drop these photos into img/ when you have them */
tw-story[tags~="bg-room-mc"]         { --bg: url("img/room-mc.jpg"); }
tw-story[tags~="bg-room-iris"]       { --bg: url("img/room-iris.jpg"); }
tw-story[tags~="bg-room-iris-clean"] { --bg: url("img/room-iris-clean.jpg"); }
tw-story[tags~="bg-room-naomi"]      { --bg: url("img/room-naomi.jpg"); }
tw-story[tags~="bg-hall-white"] { --bg: url("img/hall-white.jpg"), url(data:image/jpeg;base64,); }
tw-story[tags~="bg-black"]           { --bg: none; --ov: none; background-color: #050507; }

/* ---------- text styles ---------- */
.dayhead { font-family: 'Aurora Pro', 'BIZ UDMincho'; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 1.25em; color: #ff9cc0; }
.whisper { font-family: 'DK Jambo', 'BIZ UDMincho'; font-size: 1.15em; color: #ff6b8e; margin: 4px 0 18px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
/* phone messages: dark chat bubbles, not white boxes */
.phone {
  display: inline-block; background: #2b2837; color: #fbf7f1; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  border-radius: 16px 16px 16px 4px; padding: 7px 14px; margin: 3px 0; font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4;
}
.phone.me { background: #4f6bff; border-color: #4f6bff; color: #fff; border-radius: 16px 16px 4px 16px; }
/* perspective switch: the narration stays quiet, her own thoughts stand out in her font */
.thought {
  display: block; margin: 14px 0; padding: 12px 16px; border-left: 3px solid #b9a6e8;
  color: #c6c0d3; font-style: normal; font-size: 0.92em; background: rgba(120, 100, 180, 0.14);
}
.thought i { display: block; font-style: normal; margin: 8px 0 8px 10px; line-height: 1.35; }
.thought.iris { border-color: #8fb6ff; }
.thought.iris i { font-family: 'Stay With Me', 'BIZ UDMincho'; font-size: 1.3em; color: #cfe0ff; }
.thought.naomi { border-color: #f2a65a; background: rgba(242, 166, 90, 0.08); }
.thought.naomi i { font-family: 'Reenie Beanie', 'BIZ UDMincho'; font-size: 1.6em; color: #ffd2a6; }
.thought.maeve { border-color: #dfe8ff; background: rgba(223, 232, 255, 0.06); }
.thought.maeve i { font-family: 'BIZ UDMincho'; font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: 4px; color: #eef2ff; opacity: 0.75; }
.echo {
  display: block; margin-top: 26px; font-family: 'Stay With Me', 'BIZ UDMincho'; font-size: 1.2em;
  color: #b9a6e8; opacity: 0.7; letter-spacing: 1px;
  animation: drift 6s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.echo.naomi { color: #f2a65a; font-family: 'Reenie Beanie', 'BIZ UDMincho'; font-size: 1.45em; }
.echo.maeve { color: #dfe8ff; font-family: 'BIZ UDMincho'; font-size: 0.95em; letter-spacing: 4px; }
@keyframes drift { 0%,100% { transform: translateX(0); opacity: 0.55; } 50% { transform: translateX(6px); opacity: 0.85; } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .echo { animation: none; } }
/* Death's voice at the revival: never seen, never named */
.death { display: block; margin: 8px 0; text-align: center; font-family: 'Extra Blur', 'BIZ UDMincho'; font-size: 1.25em; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #eef2ff; }
/* a girl's inner voice, shown at the top of her scenes: her own font when she's doing better, Megalomania when she's losing herself */
.lost { display: block; margin: 0 0 16px; font-family: 'Megalomania X', 'BIZ UDMincho'; font-size: 1.25em; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #ff6b8e; }
.glow { display: block; margin: 0 0 16px; opacity: 0.9; }
.glow.iris { font-family: 'Stay With Me', 'BIZ UDMincho'; font-size: 1.35em; color: #cfe0ff; }
.glow.naomi { font-family: 'Reenie Beanie', 'BIZ UDMincho'; font-size: 1.7em; color: #ffd2a6; }
/* the small signs that Naomi is slipping */
.sign { display: block; margin: 0 0 16px; color: #bab4c8; font-size: 0.88em; font-style: italic; }
/* tappable words inside a paragraph (timed texts) */
.tw tw-link, .tw .enchantment-link { display: inline; margin: 0; padding: 0 2px; border: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #ff7aa8; border-radius: 0; background: none; color: #ff9cc0; }
.tw tw-link:hover { background: rgba(255, 122, 168, 0.18); color: #fff; }
.timer { display: block; height: 3px; margin: 10px 0 4px; background: #ff7aa8; border-radius: 2px; transform-origin: left; animation: timer 14s linear forwards; }
.timer.slow { animation-duration: 15s; }
@keyframes timer { from { transform: scaleX(1); } to { transform: scaleX(0); } }
/* Death breaking in for a moment when Iris gets too low */
.deathpop { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 50; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 24px; background: rgba(2, 2, 6, 0.9); pointer-events: none; animation: deathpop 4.5s ease forwards; }
@keyframes deathpop { 0% { opacity: 0; } 15% { opacity: 1; } 75% { opacity: 1; } 100% { opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; } }
.title { text-align: center; font-size: 2.4em; letter-spacing: 0.2em; margin: 8vh 0 0; }
/* the logo art has empty space under the lettering, hence the negative bottom margin */
.logo { background: url(data:image/webp;base64,) center / contain no-repeat; aspect-ratio: 2000 / 1131; display: block; width: min(100%, 620px); height: auto; margin: 2vh auto -12%; filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 24px rgba(240, 138, 168, 0.25)); animation: logoIn 2.4s ease-out both; }
.logo.small { width: min(80%, 380px); margin-bottom: -8%; animation: none; }
@keyframes logoIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); filter: blur(6px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 24px rgba(240, 138, 168, 0.25)); } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .logo { animation: none; } }
.subtitle { text-align: center; font-style: italic; letter-spacing: 0.3em; opacity: 0.7; }
.center { text-align: center; }
.quiet { color: #bab4c8; font-size: 0.88em; }

/* ---------- end-of-day meters ---------- */
.meter { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin: 14px 0; }
.meter .who { width: 70px; font-family: 'DK Jambo', 'BIZ UDMincho'; }
.meter .bar { flex: 1; height: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); border-radius: 7px; overflow: hidden; }
.meter .fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 7px; transition: width 1.2s ease; }
.meter .fill.iris { background: #8fb6ff; }
.meter .fill.naomi { background: #f2a65a; }
.meter .num { width: 40px; text-align: right; font-family: 'DK Jambo', 'BIZ UDMincho'; }
.switches { margin-top: 18px; letter-spacing: 6px; color: #b9a6e8; }


:: StoryInit [startup]
(set: $loop to 1)
(display: "reset vars")


:: echo footer [footer]
(if: (passage:)'s tags contains "iris" and $hauntIris)[<span class="echo">he's the only one who doesn't look at me like that</span>]
(if: (passage:)'s tags contains "naomi" and $hauntNaomi)[<span class="echo naomi">don't let him see</span>]
(if: (passage:)'s tags contains "maeve" and $hauntMaeve)[<span class="echo maeve">soon, babe</span>]


:: clamp
(set: $iris to (max: 0, (min: 100, $iris, $baseI + (cond: $react is "pizza", 12, $react is "post", 16, 20))))(set: $naomi to (max: 0, (min: 100, $naomi, $baseN + 20)))(if: $lockI)[(set: $iris to (min: $iris, $frzI))](if: $lockN)[(set: $naomi to (min: $naomi, $frzN))]


:: pick iris
(set: $devI to it + 1, $last to "iris", $iris to it + 5, $naomi to it - (cond: $day <= 3, 2, $day <= 5, 3, 4))(display: "clamp")


:: pick naomi
(set: $devN to it + 1, $last to "naomi", $naomi to it + 5, $iris to it - (cond: $day <= 3, 2, $day <= 5, 3, 4))(display: "clamp")


:: Content note [bg-black]
<div class="logo" role="img" aria-label="De Mortuis"></div>
<div class="subtitle">nil nisi bonum</div>

<p class="center quiet">This story deals with grief and suicide. Nothing is ever shown, but it's there. You can stop at any time.</p>
<p class="center quiet">If you're struggling, you don't have to carry it alone. In the US you can call or text 988, any time.</p>

(if: (saved-games:) contains "auto")[<p class="center">(link: "Continue")[(load-game: "auto")]</p>
<p class="center">[[New game->Prologue]]</p>](else:)[<p class="center">[[Begin->Prologue]]</p>]


:: Prologue [bg-black rain]
The last thing you remember is the funeral.

Not yours. Hers.

It rained, which felt like too much. People from your classes stood under umbrellas and didn't look at each other. Some of them had posted about her that week. Some of them had laughed.

Iris's mother was at the front, in a wheelchair, an oxygen line taped under her nose. You didn't know she was sick. Nobody did.

At the very back, under a tree, stood Professor Hale. The man the whole college had been whispering about. He left before anyone could see his face.

That was when you understood. Iris didn't lose her scholarship because of him. She lost it because she'd been driving three hours every weekend to take care of her mom. Hale was the only one who noticed. The only one who helped.

She told you about the scholarship once, sitting on your floor. You said //that sucks// and asked if she wanted pizza.

After that the week comes apart. Your room. Your phone, face down. 2:07 on the screen, very bright in the dark.

And then nothing.

[[...->Revival]]


:: Wake [bg-room-mc day]
(if: $loop is 2)[You wake up gasping. Again.

Sunlight. Your ceiling. Your phone buzzing on the nightstand, over and over.

You remember all of it this time. The whole week. The teal and orange hallway, the cold hands, 2:07 under a gallery light. The voice in the dark, laughing at you a little.

<span class="phone">wait is it true about iris and hale??</span>
<span class="phone">thats literally how she lost the scholarship lmao</span>

You know what's coming. The whiteboard. The post. The stairwell.

And somewhere on this campus there's a girl with white hair who already knows you're awake.

Iris is still alive. Naomi is still alive. You get one more try.](else:)[You wake up gasping.

Sunlight. Your ceiling. Your phone buzzing on the nightstand, over and over, like something trapped.

The date is wrong. It's Monday. //That// Monday.

<span class="phone">wait is it true about iris and hale??</span>
<span class="phone">thats literally how she lost the scholarship lmao</span>
<span class="phone">i always thought she was weird with him</span>

You remember the rain. You remember the voice.

One week. Two lines to watch. Somebody who'd rather not see any of you.

Iris is still alive. For now.]

[[Get up->Day 1]]


:: Day 1 [bg-gallery day]
(save-game: "auto")<div class="dayhead">MONDAY</div><div class="whisper">she slept with hale. that's how she lost it</div>
Campus looks exactly the same, which is the worst part.

Same coffee line. Same guy playing guitar badly by the fountain. But every few steps you hear it. //Her.// //That girl.// //The Hale thing.// People say it like they're talking about a TV show.

Your phone buzzes. Naomi.

<span class="phone">library. 10. dont be late</span>

(link-reveal-goto: "Skip class. Go knock on Iris's door.", "D1 Iris")[(display: "pick iris")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Go to the library. You told Naomi you'd be there.", "D1 Naomi")[(display: "pick naomi")]


:: D1 Iris [bg-room-iris day iris]
Her door opens about four inches. She's in a hoodie that's too big for her. Her eyes are puffy, but she isn't crying. She looks past that.

"Hey," she says. "I'm kind of tired."

"I can be tired with you."

She almost smiles. She opens the door wider.

She sits on her bed. You sit on the floor. Her phone is face down, and every time it buzzes her shoulders go up a little.

"You can turn it off," you say.

"Then I won't know what they're saying."

(if: $switches > 0)[(link: "▸ see what she's thinking")[(set: $switches to it - 1, $hauntIris to true)<span class="thought iris">Inside her head it's so quiet, like she's afraid of being overheard even there. //Don't make him stay. Don't be a lot. People leave when you're a lot.// And under that, softer: //he's the only one who doesn't look at me like that.//</span>]]

(link-reveal-goto: "Stay. You don't have to say anything.", "D1 Midday")[(set: $iris to it + 5)]
(link-reveal-goto: "Tell her it'll blow over in a few days.", "D1 Midday")[(set: $iris to it - 5)]


:: D1 Naomi [bg-library day naomi]
Naomi is at her table by the window with two coffees. She doesn't look up. She slides one across to you.

"You got me coffee?"

"They messed up my order." She turns a page. "Don't make it weird."

It's your order. Oat milk, one sugar.

"Have you seen what people are saying about Iris?" you ask.

Her pen stops for half a second. "Everyone's seen it. It'll die down in like two days." She looks at you. "Why do you look like you haven't slept in a week?"

(if: $switches > 0)[(link: "▸ see what she's thinking")[(set: $switches to it - 1, $hauntNaomi to true)<span class="thought naomi">Her thoughts are fast and sharp, each one cutting off the last. //Oat milk, one sugar. Don't let him notice you remembered. He looks awful. Ask him. No. Don't.// And one that keeps coming back: //don't let him see.//</span>]]

(link-reveal-goto: "Thank her for the coffee. Properly.", "D1 Midday")[(set: $naomi to it + 5)]
(link-reveal-goto: "Ask why she's being weird.", "D1 Midday")[(set: $naomi to it - 5)]


:: D1 Evening [bg-lab day]
The day drags. In class, two people behind you are watching something on a phone and laughing. You hear "Hale" twice.

At the end of the day your phone buzzes twice.

<span class="phone">are you still on campus</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Iris</span>
<span class="phone">walking back. you coming or what</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Naomi</span>

(link-reveal-goto: "Walk Iris back to her dorm. The long way, past the lake.", "Walk home")[(set: $walked to "iris", $iris to it + 5)]
(link-reveal-goto: "Catch up to Naomi before she leaves.", "Walk home")[(set: $walked to "naomi", $naomi to it + 5)]
(link-reveal-goto: "Walk home alone.", "Walk home")[(set: $walked to "alone")]


:: Day 2 [bg-classroom day hub]
(save-game: "auto")<div class="dayhead">TUESDAY</div><div class="whisper">everyone knows about her and hale</div>
Someone has written HALE + IRIS on the whiteboard in your first class. The professor erases it without a word. Nobody looks at anybody.

<span class="phone">hasnt left her room since yesterday btw</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Iris's roommate</span>
<span class="phone">theres a cafe off campus thats better than everywhere. ur coming</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Naomi</span>

(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devI >= $devN, "Bring Iris lunch. The sandwich place with too much pickle.", "Bring Iris lunch. Someone should."), "D2 Iris")[(display: "pick iris")]
(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devN >= $devI, "Let Naomi drag you to that dumb café she likes.", "Go to Naomi's café. She said you're coming, not asked."), "D2 Naomi")[(display: "pick naomi")]


:: D2 Iris [bg-room-iris day iris]
She eats half the sandwich cross-legged on her bed, slowly, like she has to remember how.

"Professor Hale emailed me," she says. "He can't meet with me anymore. Department said. Until it's 'resolved.'"

"I'm sorry."

"He was the only one who..." She stops. "Never mind."

(if: $switches > 0)[(link: "▸ see what she's thinking")[(set: $switches to it - 1, $hauntIris to true)<span class="thought iris">//Two hours. He drove two hours. And now he can't even email me back.// She wants to tell you. The words are right there. //Not yet. If I say it, it's real.// And then, again: //he's the only one who doesn't look at me like that.//</span>]]

(link-reveal-goto: "Leave the other half in her fridge with a note: eat this, idiot.", "D2 Midday")[(set: $iris to it + 5)]
(link-reveal-goto: "Ask her what's actually going on with Hale.", "D2 Midday")[(set: $iris to it - 5)]


:: D2 Naomi [bg-cafe day naomi]
The café isn't better than everywhere. The chairs are wobbly and the music is too loud. She pushes half her cake across to you without asking.

"So how's Iris," she says, like she's asking about the weather.

"Bad."

"Yeah." She stabs the cake. "She was already freaking out about the money, and now this? That's so much." A beat. "Not that I care. I barely know her."

"You just said it was so much."

"It //is// so much. That's a fact. That's not caring."

(if: $switches > 0)[(link: "▸ see what she's thinking")[(set: $switches to it - 1, $hauntNaomi to true)<span class="thought naomi">//I said her name to someone. That's all. Two weeks ago. That's all I said.// She pushes the thought down, hard. //Eat the cake. Be normal. Don't let him see.//</span>]]

(link-reveal-goto: "Eat your half.", "D2 Midday")[(set: $naomi to it + 5)]
(link-reveal-goto: "Tell her she clearly cares.", "D2 Midday")[(set: $naomi to it - 5)]


:: D2 Night [bg-vending night maeve]
(set: $metMaeve to true)(if: $loop is 2)[The vending machine eats your dollar, exactly like last time. You don't even get angry. You just wait.

"Oh, you're //waiting// for me," Maeve says behind you. "That's adorable."

She taps the glass once. Your chips drop, and the sour gummy worms behind them. She feeds you one before you can take the bag.

"Tomorrow night, babe. Same date as last time." Her hand slides down your arm, so cold it almost burns. "Unless you've gone off me. You haven't gone off me."

She walks away down the hall. You don't bother listening for the stairwell door. You know it won't open.](else:)[That night the vending machine on your floor eats your dollar.

You're standing there in your socks, too tired to be angry, when someone says, "Oh, that's so sad. Look at you."

(if: $alone > 0)[It's Maeve, leaning against the wall beside the machine. You didn't hear her walk up.](else-if: $sawMaeve)[There's a girl leaning against the wall beside the machine. Long white hair. Very pale eyes. It's the girl who walked into you last night.](else:)[There's a girl leaning against the wall beside the machine. You didn't hear her walk up. Long white hair. Very pale eyes. An oversized coat that looks expensive.]

"Let me." She studies the buttons like she's never seen a vending machine in her life. Presses three wrong ones. Frowns at it, genuinely offended. Then she taps the glass once, very lightly, and your chips drop. And behind them, the sour gummy worms. Your favourite. You never told her that.

She hands you both. Her fingers are freezing.

"I'm Maeve," she says(if: $alone > 0)[, again, like you might have forgotten]. "You look like you've had a day, babe. Take me out tomorrow night. I'll make you forget everything for a few hours. Promise."

She doesn't wait for an answer. She walks off down the hall. You never hear the stairwell door open.]

(if: $switches > 0)[(link: "▸ see what she's thinking")[(set: $switches to it - 1, $hauntMaeve to true)<span class="thought maeve">You reach for her the way you would anyone. There's nothing there. No worries, no plans, no other people. Just you, seen from very close, warm and lit up like a window. //Oh, he's sweet.// //soon, babe.//</span>]]

[[Go back to your room->D2 Walk]]


:: D2 Walk [bg-hall-red night]
Your phone buzzes before you've made it to your door.

<span class="phone">are you up</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Iris</span>
<span class="phone">im outside your building. dont read into it</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Naomi</span>

