:: D3 Iris [bg-lab day iris]
The computer lab is empty except for Iris and one humming printer. She's sitting at a screen with nothing open on it.

"My roommate's friends were in our room," she says. "They didn't know I was awake. They were talking about it. About what I'd have to do to... you know." She pulls her sleeves over her hands. "I just got up and left. In my socks."

She's in her socks.

You pull a chair over. After a while she leans her head on your shoulder, very lightly, like she's checking whether that's allowed.

"I keep thinking everyone would have an easier week if I just wasn't around," she says. Lightly. Then she asks if you've done the reading, before you can answer.

(if: $switches > 0)[(link: "▸ see what she's thinking")[(set: $switches to it - 1, $hauntIris to true)<span class="thought iris">//He came. He actually came.// //Don't say the other thing again. Don't scare him.// And under everything, softer: //he's the only one who doesn't look at me like that.//</span>]]

(link-reveal-goto: "\"I'd have a worse week. A lot worse.\"", "D3 Midday")[(set: $iris to it + 5)]
(link-reveal-goto: "Let it go. Talk about the reading.", "D3 Midday")[(set: $iris to it - 5)]


:: D3 Naomi [bg-room-naomi day naomi]
Naomi opens the door in yesterday's hoodie. Her room is a mess, which it never is.

"I didn't sleep," she says. "It's not a big deal. I just didn't want to be the only one awake."

She sits on her bed with her laptop open to a page she closes when you look.

"Someone in my class asked me if it was true," she says. "About Iris and Hale. Like //I'd// know." Her voice goes thin. "I told her to shut up about it."

(if: $switches > 0)[(link: "▸ see what she's thinking")[(set: $switches to it - 1, $hauntNaomi to true)<span class="thought naomi">//I said her name. Two weeks ago. That's all I said.// //That's all I said, right?// And underneath, over and over: //don't let him see.//</span>]]

(link-reveal-goto: "\"That was the right thing to say.\"", "D3 Midday")[(set: $naomi to it + 5)]
(link-reveal-goto: "\"Why would she ask //you//?\"", "D3 Midday")[(set: $naomi to it - 5)]


