:: D4 Iris Night [bg-lab night iris]
Iris is in the empty computer lab. The only light is one screen. Her phone is face down next to the keyboard.

(if: $irisTold)["Mom had a bad night," she says. "I can't do anything from here. I just didn't want to be in my room."](else:)["I just couldn't sleep," she says. That isn't all of it. You can tell.]

You pull a chair over and sit next to her. For a long time neither of you says anything.

"I keep thinking," she says, "that if I just wasn't here, (if: $irisTold)[she](else:)[everyone] wouldn't have to worry about me on top of everything. One less thing."

She says it very lightly, then changes the subject before you can answer.

(if: $switches > 0)[(link: "▸ see what she's thinking")[(set: $switches to it - 1, $hauntIris to true)<span class="thought iris">She stares at the screen. //One less thing. One less thing.// Then she glances at you. //He came. He actually came.// //he's the only one who doesn't look at me like that.//</span>]]

(link-reveal-goto: "Stay until the building closes. Walk her back to her dorm.", "Walk home")[(set: $walked to "iris", $iris to it + 5)]


:: D4 Naomi Night [bg-room-naomi night naomi]
Naomi opens the door before you knock. She's holding her phone like it's hot.

"I worked it out," she says. "Two weeks ago I told someone Iris was freaking out about money. That's all I said. I didn't say Hale. I swear I didn't say anything about Hale. But that's where it started, isn't it?"

She sits on the floor. You sit next to her. At least she isn't alone when it hits her.

Your phone buzzes once. <span class="phone">its ok. dont worry about me.</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Iris</span>

(set: $naomiFound to true, $naomi to it - 5)(display: "clamp")
(link-reveal-goto: "Stay until she falls asleep.", "Walk home")[(set: $walked to "naomi", $naomi to it + 5)]


