:: D7 Evening [bg-room-iris-clean night iris]
Iris's room is too clean.

Her desk is cleared. Her sketchbook is closed with a hair tie around it, like something finished. She's given her good jacket to her roommate. "She always liked it," Iris says, when you ask. Like it's nothing.

(if: $lockI)[She lets you stay. She doesn't look at you. "You don't have to pretend," she says. "It's fine. You can go."

](else:)[You sit on the floor. She sits on the bed. Like Monday.]

(if: $dating)[Your phone buzzes. <span class="phone">dont be long babe</span> You turn it face down.

]
