(display: "clamp")<div class="dayhead">THE END OF THE WEEK</div>
<div class="meter"><span class="who">Iris</span><div class="bar">(print: '<div class="fill iris" style="width:' + (str: $iris) + '%"></div>')</div><span class="num">$iris</span></div>
<div class="meter"><span class="who">Naomi</span><div class="bar">(print: '<div class="fill naomi" style="width:' + (str: $naomi) + '%"></div>')</div><span class="num">$naomi</span></div>

(if: $dating)[(if: $iris >= 35 and $naomi >= 35 and not $lockI and not $lockN)[(link-goto: "...", "End She Waits")](else:)[(link-goto: "...", "End All Three")]](else-if: $iris < 35 or $naomi < 35 or $lockI or $lockN)[(link-goto: "...", "End Bad")](else-if: $iris >= (cond: $react is "pizza", 90, $react is "post", 75, 60) and $naomi >= 60 and $leaks is 0 and not $capI and not $capN)[(link-goto: "...", "End Good")](else:)[(link-goto: "...", "End Middle")]


:: D1 Midday [bg-hall-brick day hub]
Lunch. The hallway fills up and empties again. Twice you hear Iris's name, both times from people who've never spoken to her.

Neither of them is in the dining hall.

(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devI >= $devN, "Take Iris some food. She hasn't eaten all day.", "Drop some food at Iris's. You should check on her."), "D1 Midday Iris")[(display: "pick iris")]
(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devN >= $devI, "Find Naomi. She skipped lunch too.", "Text Naomi back. She's asked where you are twice."), "D1 Midday Naomi")[(display: "pick naomi")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Eat alone. You need a minute to think.", "Alone")[(set: $next to "D1 Afternoon")(display: "go alone")]


:: D1 Midday Iris [bg-room-iris day iris]
She takes the sandwich and doesn't open it. She just holds it.

"Can I ask you something?" she says. "Do people really believe it? About me and Hale?"

(set: $mtFrom to "naomi")(display: "midtext")
|ch)[(link-reveal-goto: "\"Some people. Not the ones who matter.\"", "D1 Midday Iris 2")[(set: $iris to it + 5)]
(link-reveal-goto: "\"Honestly? Most people do.\"", "D1 Midday Iris 2")[(set: $iris to it - 5)]](if: $mtSkip)[(show: ?ch)]


:: D1 Midday Iris 2 [bg-room-iris day iris]
She nods slowly, like she's filing it away somewhere.

Then she unwraps the sandwich and eats a quarter of it. It's not much. It's more than this morning.

[[Keep going->D1 Afternoon]]


:: D1 Midday Naomi [bg-cafe day naomi]
Naomi is in the corner of the café with her headphones in and nothing playing. At the next table, two people are talking about Iris loud enough for the whole room.

"People are so loud," Naomi says, to no one. She doesn't look at you.

(set: $mtFrom to "iris")(display: "midtext")
|ch)[(link-reveal-goto: "Tell the next table to shut up.", "D1 Midday Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it + 5, $mid1 to "loud")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Laugh it off. \"They'll get bored.\"", "D1 Midday Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it - 5, $mid1 to "laugh")]](if: $mtSkip)[(show: ?ch)]


:: D1 Midday Naomi 2 [bg-cafe day naomi]
(if: $mid1 is "loud")[The table goes quiet. Somebody mutters something. Nobody says Iris's name again.

Naomi takes one headphone out. "...That was kind of cool," she says. "Don't let it go to your head."](else:)[Naomi looks at you for a second too long.

"Yeah," she says. "Hilarious." She puts the headphone back in.]

[[Keep going->D1 Afternoon]]


:: D2 Midday [bg-hall-posters day hub]
Between classes. The hallway is a gauntlet: people glance at their phones, then at whoever walks past.

Iris has a class across campus. Naomi texts <span class="phone">are you avoiding me or what</span>

(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devI >= $devN, "Walk Iris to her class.", "Iris has to cross campus alone. Go."), "D2 Midday Iris")[(display: "pick iris")]
(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devN >= $devI, "Answer Naomi. Go find her.", "Answer Naomi. She's not wrong, you have been."), "D2 Midday Naomi")[(display: "pick naomi")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Ignore your phone. Find an empty hallway.", "Alone")[(set: $next to "D2 Afternoon")(display: "go alone")]


:: D2 Midday Iris [bg-hall-posters day iris]
Iris keeps her hood up and her eyes on the floor. People step aside for her like she's contagious.

Someone films her on their phone. They don't even try to hide it.

(set: $mtFrom to "naomi")(display: "midtext")
|ch)[(link-reveal-goto: "Walk right next to her, so they have to look at you too.", "D2 Midday Iris 2")[(set: $iris to it + 5, $mid2 to "next")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Walk a few steps behind. Don't make it worse.", "D2 Midday Iris 2")[(set: $iris to it - 5, $mid2 to "behind")]](if: $mtSkip)[(show: ?ch)]


:: D2 Midday Iris 2 [bg-hall-posters day iris]
(if: $mid2 is "next")[You walk so close your sleeves touch. At her door, Iris breathes out like she's been holding it since Monday.

"Thanks," she says. She means it.](else:)[She notices. She doesn't say anything. At her door she goes in without looking back.]

[[Keep going->D2 Afternoon]]


:: D2 Midday Naomi [bg-library day naomi]
"You've been weird since Monday," Naomi says, the second you sit down. "Like, weirder than usual. What's going on with you?"

(set: $mtFrom to "iris")(display: "midtext")
|ch)[(link-reveal-goto: "\"I had a really bad dream. I can't shake it.\"", "D2 Midday Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it + 5, $mid2 to "dream")]
(link-reveal-goto: "\"Nothing. I'm fine.\"", "D2 Midday Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it - 5, $mid2 to "fine")]](if: $mtSkip)[(show: ?ch)]


:: D2 Midday Naomi 2 [bg-library day naomi]
(if: $mid2 is "dream")[She's quiet for a moment.

"...What kind of dream," she says. Not a question, exactly. She waits anyway.

You don't tell her. But she stays next to you for the rest of the hour, and she doesn't put her headphones in.](else:)["Whatever," she says. "Don't tell me, then. Not like I care."

She flips a page she hasn't read.]

[[Keep going->D2 Afternoon]]


:: D3 Midday [bg-hall-brick day hub]
The dining hall is the loudest place on campus. Iris hasn't eaten there since Monday. Naomi hasn't eaten at all, from the look of her.

(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devI >= $devN, "Get Iris to come to the dining hall with you.", "Iris hasn't eaten in public all week. Try."), "D3 Midday Iris")[(display: "pick iris")]
(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devN >= $devI, "Make Naomi eat something.", "Naomi looks grey. Make her eat."), "D3 Midday Naomi")[(display: "pick naomi")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Skip lunch. Walk it off alone.", "Alone")[(set: $next to "D3 Afternoon")(display: "go alone")]


:: D3 Midday Iris [bg-lounge day iris]
She agrees, which surprises both of you. Inside, it gets quieter when she walks in. Not silent. Just quieter.

"I can't do this," she whispers.

(set: $mtFrom to "naomi")(display: "midtext")
|ch)[(link-reveal-goto: "Sit in the middle, where everyone can see you both.", "D3 Midday Iris 2")[(set: $iris to it + 5, $mid3 to "middle")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Grab food to go. Eat it somewhere quiet.", "D3 Midday Iris 2")[(set: $mid3 to "quiet")]](if: $mtSkip)[(show: ?ch)]


:: D3 Midday Iris 2 [bg-lounge day iris]
(if: $mid3 is "middle")[It's awful for about five minutes. Then people get bored, the way people do, and go back to their own lunches.

Iris finishes her whole plate. She looks at it like she can't believe it.](else:)[You eat on the back steps. It's cold. Iris eats half of hers.

"Thanks for not making me stay," she says.]

[[Afternoon->D3 Afternoon]]


:: D3 Midday Naomi [bg-cafe day naomi]
"I'm not hungry," Naomi says.

"You look like a ghost."

"Wow. Thanks." She glares at you. Then at the muffin you put in front of her.

(set: $mtFrom to "iris")(display: "midtext")
|ch)[(link-reveal-goto: "Don't move until she eats it.", "D3 Midday Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it + 5, $mid3 to "stay")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Fine. Tell her to worry about herself, then.", "D3 Midday Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it - 5, $mid3 to "leave")]](if: $mtSkip)[(show: ?ch)]


:: D3 Midday Naomi 2 [bg-cafe day naomi]
(if: $mid3 is "stay")[A standoff. She lasts about forty seconds.

"This is so stupid," she says, eating it. She eats all of it. She doesn't say thank you. She does push her coffee toward you when she's done.](else:)["I am worrying about myself," she says. "Somebody has to."

She leaves the muffin where it is.]

[[Afternoon->D3 Afternoon]]


:: D4 Midday [bg-hall-posters day hub]
Midday. Iris texts <span class="phone">can you help me with something. its dumb</span>

Naomi walks past you in the hallway without stopping, which she has never once done.

(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devI >= $devN, "Go help Iris.", "Iris asked for help. She doesn't do that."), "D4 Midday Iris")[(display: "pick iris")]
(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devN >= $devI, "Go after Naomi.", "Naomi just walked past you. Go after her."), "D4 Midday Naomi")[(display: "pick naomi")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Let them both go. Walk the other way.", "Alone")[(set: $next to "D4 Afternoon")(display: "go alone")]


:: D4 Midday Iris [bg-lab day iris]
It's an email to the scholarship office. She's written the first line nine times. <span class="phone">Dear Financial Aid Office, I am writing to</span>

"I don't know how to say it without saying all of it," she says.(if: $irisTold)[ "About my mom."]

(set: $mtFrom to "naomi")(display: "midtext")
|ch)[(link-reveal-goto: "Help her write it. Only what she wants in it.", "D4 Midday Iris 2")[(set: $iris to it + 5, $mid4 to "help")]
(link-reveal-goto: "\"Maybe wait until things calm down?\"", "D4 Midday Iris 2")[(set: $iris to it - 5, $mid4 to "wait")]](if: $mtSkip)[(show: ?ch)]


:: D4 Midday Iris 2 [bg-lab day iris]
(if: $mid4 is "help")[It takes an hour. Most of it is her deleting things. When it's done, it's four sentences long, and every one of them is true.

She doesn't send it yet. But she saves it. "Okay," she says. "Okay."](else:)["Right," she says. "Yeah. Things will calm down."

She closes the laptop. She doesn't open it again while you're there.]

[[Keep going->D4 Afternoon]]


:: D4 Midday Naomi [bg-hall-brick day naomi]
You catch up with her at the stairs.

"What," she says.

"You walked right past me."

"I have places to be." She doesn't move. She doesn't have places to be.

(set: $mtFrom to "iris")(display: "midtext")
|ch)[(link-reveal-goto: "\"I'll walk you to them.\"", "D4 Midday Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it + 5, $mid4 to "walk")]
(link-reveal-goto: "\"Okay. See you later then.\"", "D4 Midday Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it - 5, $mid4 to "go")]](if: $mtSkip)[(show: ?ch)]


:: D4 Midday Naomi 2 [bg-hall-brick day naomi]
(if: $mid4 is "walk")["Ugh. Fine." She walks. You walk. Neither of you says where you're going. You end up at the vending machines and she buys two drinks without asking which one you want.

It's the right one.](else:)["Yeah," she says. "Later."

She goes up the stairs. You hear her stop halfway, and then keep going.]

[[Keep going->D4 Afternoon]]


:: D5 Later [bg-hall-posters day hub]
Late afternoon. The building is emptying out for the weekend, but not fast enough.

(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devI >= $devN, "Check on Iris before she goes back to her room.", "Iris is about to walk past everyone. Get there first."), "D5 Later Iris")[(display: "pick iris")]
(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devN >= $devI, "Find Naomi. She went quiet again.", "Naomi's gone quiet. That's worse than angry."), "D5 Later Naomi")[(display: "pick naomi")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Get out of the building. Alone.", "Alone")[(set: $next to "D5 Late")(display: "go alone")]


:: D5 Later Iris [bg-hall-posters day iris]
Two people by the stairs are saying it out loud as Iris walks past. Not whispering. Saying it.

Iris stops walking.

(set: $mtFrom to "naomi")(display: "midtext")
|ch)[(link-reveal-goto: "Stand next to her and stare them down.", "D5 Later Iris 2")[(set: $iris to it + 5, $mid5 to "stand")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Get her out of there, fast.", "D5 Later Iris 2")[(set: $mid5 to "leave")]](if: $mtSkip)[(show: ?ch)]


:: D5 Later Iris 2 [bg-hall-posters day iris]
(if: $mid5 is "stand")[They don't stop right away. Then they do. One of them actually looks embarrassed.

Iris's hands are shaking. "You didn't have to do that," she says. She holds on to your sleeve for the rest of the hallway.](else:)[You steer her round the corner. She leans against the wall and breathes.

"It's fine," she says. "I'm used to it now." That's the worst thing she's said all week.]

[[Keep going->D5 Late]]


:: D5 Later Naomi [bg-classroom day naomi]
Naomi is in an empty classroom, typing on her phone. She deletes it. Types again. Deletes it.

"I'm writing to Iris," she says, before you ask. "To say sorry. Every version sounds like I'm making it about me."

(set: $mtFrom to "iris")(display: "midtext")
|ch)[(link-reveal-goto: "\"You don't have to fix it alone.\"", "D5 Later Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it + 5, $mid5 to "alone")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Say nothing. Let her figure it out.", "D5 Later Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it - 5, $mid5 to "quiet")]](if: $mtSkip)[(show: ?ch)]


:: D5 Later Naomi 2 [bg-classroom day naomi]
(if: $mid5 is "alone")[She stops typing.

"Don't say nice things to me right now," she says. "I'll cry, and then I'll have to kill you."

She doesn't cry. She puts the phone face down and sits with you until the lights in the hallway switch off.](else:)[She types for a long time. Then she puts the phone away without sending anything.

"Forget it," she says.]

[[Keep going->D5 Late]]


:: D6 Later [bg-hall-brick day hub]
The day's almost over. Tomorrow is the night it happened.

(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devI >= $devN, "Go back to Iris.", "Go back to Iris. You haven't been there enough."), "D6 Later Iris")[(display: "pick iris")]
(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devN >= $devI, "Stay with Naomi a bit longer.", "Go find Naomi. Whatever's between you."), "D6 Later Naomi")[(display: "pick naomi")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Walk around campus alone until it gets dark.", "Alone")[(set: $next to "D6 Late")(display: "go alone")]


:: D6 Later Iris [bg-room-iris day iris]
Iris tears a page out of her sketchbook and hands it to you. It's a drawing of the view from her window. It's really good.

"You can have it," she says. "I want you to have it."

(set: $mtFrom to "naomi")(display: "midtext")
|ch)[(link-reveal-goto: "\"Why are you giving it away?\"", "D6 Later Iris 2")[(set: $iris to it + 5, $mid6 to "ask")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Say thanks and put it in your bag.", "D6 Later Iris 2")[(set: $iris to it - 5, $mid6 to "thanks")]](if: $mtSkip)[(show: ?ch)]


:: D6 Later Iris 2 [bg-room-iris day iris]
(if: $mid6 is "ask")[She shrugs. "I don't know. I just wanted you to have something."

"I'll give it back when you finish the next one," you say.

She looks at you for a long moment. "Okay," she says. "Deal."](else:)["Good," she says. She smiles, and it doesn't reach her eyes.]

[[Keep going->D6 Late]]


:: D6 Later Naomi [bg-room-naomi day naomi]
(if: $confessedNaomi)[Naomi is lying on her floor with her feet on the bed. "That movie was a crime," she says. "Rate it. Out of ten. Wrong answers will be punished."](else:)[Naomi is lying on her floor with her feet on the bed, staring at the ceiling. "You're still here," she says. It's not clear if that's good.]

(set: $mtFrom to "iris")(display: "midtext")
|ch)[(link-reveal-goto: "Lie down on the floor next to her.", "D6 Later Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it + 5, $mid6 to "floor")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Tell her you should go.", "D6 Later Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it - 5, $mid6 to "go")]](if: $mtSkip)[(show: ?ch)]


:: D6 Later Naomi 2 [bg-room-naomi day naomi]
(if: $mid6 is "floor")[You lie down. The carpet smells like her coffee.

"This is stupid," she says, after a while. She doesn't move either.](else:)["Yeah," she says to the ceiling. "Go."]

[[Keep going->D6 Late]]


:: D7 Later [bg-hall-posters day hub]
The afternoon of the last day. You keep checking the time.

(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devI >= $devN, "Find Iris before tonight.", "Find Iris. Now. Before tonight."), "D7 Later Iris")[(display: "pick iris")]
(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devN >= $devI, "Find Naomi before tonight.", "Find Naomi. You can't do tonight without her."), "D7 Later Naomi")[(display: "pick naomi")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Walk. Alone. Just for a bit.", "Alone")[(set: $next to "D7 Late")(display: "go alone")]


:: D7 Later Iris [bg-hall-brick day iris]
Iris is on the steps outside her building. When she sees you she stands up very straight.

"Thank you for this week," she says. Too formal. Like she's practised it. "Really. You were really good to me."

(set: $mtFrom to "naomi")(display: "midtext")
|ch)[(link-reveal-goto: "\"I'm coming over tonight. Don't argue.\"", "D7 Later Iris 2")[(set: $iris to it + 5, $mid7 to "tonight")]
(link-reveal-goto: "\"Any time.\" Go to class.", "D7 Later Iris 2")[(set: $iris to it - 5, $mid7 to "anytime")]](if: $mtSkip)[(show: ?ch)]


:: D7 Later Iris 2 [bg-hall-brick day iris]
(if: $mid7 is "tonight")["...Okay," she says. Something in her face moves. "Okay. Come after dinner."](else:)["Yeah," she says. "Any time."

She watches you go.]

[[Keep going->D7 Late]]


:: D7 Later Naomi [bg-library day naomi]
(if: $hidNaomi)[Naomi is at her table. She doesn't look up. She doesn't leave either.](else:)[Naomi is at her table, not studying.]

"Go see Iris tonight," she says. "I mean it. Something's off with her."

(set: $mtFrom to "iris")(display: "midtext")
|ch)[(link-reveal-goto: "\"Come with me.\"", "D7 Later Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it + 5, $mid7 to "come")]
(link-reveal-goto: "\"I'll handle it.\"", "D7 Later Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it - 5, $mid7 to "handle")]](if: $mtSkip)[(show: ?ch)]


:: D7 Later Naomi 2 [bg-library day naomi]
(if: $mid7 is "come")["She doesn't want me there," Naomi says. "But... text me. If you need me. I'll come."](else:)["Fine," she says. "Handle it, then."

She goes back to not studying.]

[[Keep going->D7 Late]]


:: Night texts [bg-room-mc night]
Your phone buzzes twice before you're even in bed.

(if: $day is 1)[<span class="phone">sorry for being weird today</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Iris</span>
<span class="phone">did you even eat</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Naomi</span>](else-if: $day is 2)[<span class="phone">are people still talking about it</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Iris</span>
<span class="phone">that cafe was mid btw. we're going again</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Naomi</span>](else-if: $day is 3)[<span class="phone">thank you for today</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Iris</span>
<span class="phone">go to sleep. you look terrible</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Naomi</span>](else-if: $day is 4)[<span class="phone">my mom is ok for now. why do i still feel like this</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Iris</span>
(if: $naomiFound)[<span class="phone">i cant stop reading the posts</span>](else:)[<span class="phone">whatever. night</span>] &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Naomi</span>](else-if: $day is 5)[<span class="phone">i didnt go to class again</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Iris</span>
<span class="phone">dont text me</span>
<span class="phone">ok you can text me</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Naomi</span>](else:)[<span class="phone">can i talk to you tomorrow</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Iris</span>
(if: $confessedNaomi)[<span class="phone">idiot. sleep.</span>](else:)[<span class="phone">.</span>] &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Naomi</span>]

(if: $loop is 1 and $day >= 2)[<span class="tw">You could (link: "reply to Iris")[(set: $iris to it + 5, $replied to "iris")(go-to: "Night reply")], (link: "reply to Naomi")[(set: $naomi to it + 5, $replied to "naomi")(go-to: "Night reply")], or (link: "put the phone face down")[(set: $replied to "none")(go-to: "Night reply")].</span><span class="timer slow"></span>(live: 15s)[(stop:)(set: $replied to "late")(if: $iris < $naomi)[(set: $iris to it - 3)](else:)[(set: $naomi to it - 3)](go-to: "Night reply")]](else:)[(link-reveal-goto: "Reply to Iris.", "Night reply")[(set: $iris to it + 5, $replied to "iris")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Reply to Naomi.", "Night reply")[(set: $naomi to it + 5, $replied to "naomi")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Put the phone face down.", "Night reply")[(set: $replied to "none")]]


:: Night reply [bg-room-mc night]
(if: $replied is "iris")[(if: $day is 1)[<span class="phone me">you weren't weird. sleep ok?</span>
<span class="phone">ok. thank you</span>](else-if: $day is 2)[<span class="phone me">less than yesterday. it'll keep getting quieter</span>
<span class="phone">ok</span>](else-if: $day is 3)[<span class="phone me">any time. same time tomorrow?</span>
<span class="phone">yeah</span>](else-if: $day is 4)[<span class="phone me">because it was a lot. you dont have to feel ok yet</span>
<span class="phone">ok</span>](else-if: $day is 5)[<span class="phone me">thats ok. ill walk you monday</span>
<span class="phone">ok</span>](else:)[<span class="phone me">of course. anything</span>
<span class="phone">ok. goodnight</span>]](else-if: $replied is "naomi")[(if: $day is 1)[<span class="phone me">yes mom</span>
<span class="phone">dont call me that. eat breakfast too</span>](else-if: $day is 2)[<span class="phone me">you said it was better than everywhere</span>
<span class="phone">i was wrong. dont tell anyone</span>](else-if: $day is 3)[<span class="phone me">thanks. you too</span>
<span class="phone">i look great. go to sleep</span>](else-if: $day is 4)[(if: $naomiFound)[<span class="phone me">stop reading them. im here</span>
<span class="phone">ok. stopping</span>](else:)[<span class="phone me">night naomi</span>
<span class="phone">night</span>]](else-if: $day is 5)[<span class="phone me">im texting you</span>
<span class="phone">i noticed</span>](else:)[<span class="phone me">night</span>
<span class="phone">night idiot</span>]](else-if: $replied is "late")[You take too long choosing. By the time you start typing, the screen has gone dark, and neither of them texts again.](else:)[You put the phone face down. It buzzes once more. You don't look.]

[[Sleep->End of day]]


:: Walk home [bg-hall-red night]
(display: "clamp")(if: $walked is "iris")[(if: $iris < 30)[You walk her to her door. She barely hugs back. Her arms hardly close around you. But she's the one who started it.](else-if: $iris < 60)[At her door she leans in and hugs you. Her arms actually close this time.](else:)[She hugs you for a long time, longer than she means to, then laughs into your jacket when she realises.]
(if: $hauntIris)[<span class="echo">he's the only one who doesn't look at me like that</span>]](else-if: $walked is "naomi")[(if: $naomi < 30)[At her door you open your arms. She looks at them and says, "Don't." You put them down.](else-if: $naomi < 60)["Ugh. Fine." She hugs you, stiff, fast, like ripping off a bandage.](else:)["Okay, that's enough of that," she says, hugging you. She doesn't let go first.]
(if: $hauntNaomi)[<span class="echo naomi">don't let him see</span>]](else-if: $walked is "maeve")[Maeve's hug is perfect. Warm. Smells like cold air. Her hands are freezing on the back of your neck.

"You're so good at this, babe," she says. "Letting someone take care of you."
(if: $hauntMaeve)[<span class="echo maeve">soon, babe</span>]](else-if: $loop is 2)[Maeve is waiting on the low wall outside your building, legs crossed, like she owns the wall too.

"Walk me home, babe," she says. "Oh, wait. You don't know where I live."

She laughs like it's the best joke in the world. You're almost certain you do know where she lives. You don't say it.
(if: $hauntMaeve)[<span class="echo maeve">soon, babe</span>]](else:)[(if: $day is 1)[(set: $sawMaeve to true)Halfway home someone walks straight into you. White hair. An oversized coat. Cold hands on your arm to steady you.

"Careful, babe," she says, like she already knows you.

By the time you turn around, the path is empty.](else-if: $day is 2)[Maeve is sitting on the low wall outside your building, swinging her legs.

"Walking alone again? You're making it very easy for me to find you."

She falls into step beside you all the way to your door. She doesn't hug you. She just waves, and her hand looks very pale under the streetlight.](else-if: $day is 3)["You look like you've been holding someone up all day," Maeve says, suddenly beside you at the crossing. "Who holds //you// up?"

You don't have an answer. She seems to like that.](else-if: $day is 4)[She's waiting under the one broken streetlight on your path.

"Long night," Maeve says. It isn't a question. She already knows where you were.](else-if: $day is 5)[Maeve walks the whole way with you and doesn't say a word. At your door she finally speaks, softly.

"You can't be everywhere, babe. Nobody can."](else:)["Tomorrow's the big one," Maeve says, falling into step beside you. You never told her that.

"Don't look so scared. I'll be around."]
(if: $hauntMaeve)[<span class="echo maeve">soon, babe</span>]]

[[Check your phone->Night texts]]


:: End of day [bg-black eod]
(display: "clamp")(set: $iris to it - (cond: $day <= 3, 10, $day <= 5, 18, 10))(set: $naomi to it - (cond: $day is 1, 0, $day is 2, 4, $day is 3, 6, $day is 4, 14, $day is 5, 16, $confessedNaomi, 4, 12))(if: $naomiFound and not $confessedNaomi)[(set: $naomi to it - 5)](if: $dating)[(set: $iris to it - 5)(set: $naomi to it - 5)](set: $aloneToday to 0)(display: "clamp")(set: $baseI to $iris, $baseN to $naomi)<div class="dayhead">END OF DAY $day</div>
<div class="meter"><span class="who">Iris</span><div class="bar">(print: '<div class="fill iris" style="width:' + (str: $iris) + '%"></div>')</div><span class="num">$iris</span></div>
<div class="meter"><span class="who">Naomi</span><div class="bar">(print: '<div class="fill naomi" style="width:' + (str: $naomi) + '%"></div>')</div><span class="num">$naomi</span></div>
<div class="switches">(for: each _i, ...(range: 1, 5))[(if: _i <= $switches)[●](else:)[○]]</div>
(set: $day to it + 1)
(link-goto: "Sleep", "Day " + (str: $day))


:: End Good [bg-stairs-yellow day]
<div class="dayhead">A MONTH LATER</div>
The rumour is old news. Not because anyone apologised. People just found something else to talk about. That's how it works.

Iris goes to the counselling centre twice a week. Her mom is home, on a new treatment, still singing badly in the car. Professor Hale is cleared. On the last day of term he passes Iris in the hallway and nods, and she nods back, and it's enough.

The three of you have a table now. Naomi's table, by the window. She pretends she hates sharing it. Every morning there are three coffees on it.

"They messed up my order," she says, every single time.

Nobody has ever corrected her.

[[...->Reveal Good]]


:: Reveal Good [bg-vending night maeve]
That first night, after 2:07 came and went, you stepped into the hallway to breathe. Maeve was leaning against the vending machine, holding a coffee. For the first time, she was drinking it.

"Huh," she said. "I didn't see that coming. I love that."

"Who are you?"

"I'm the one who was here last time, babe. For her. And then for you." She dropped the cup in the bin. "I brought you back to see what you'd do. Most people do the same thing again. You didn't."(if: $loop is 2)[ She smiled. "Took you two tries. You were so much better at it once you stopped looking at me."]

She fixed your collar, gently. "Tell them how it feels too. Not just the facts. You weren't supposed to do any of this alone."

"You wanted us to make it," you said. "All three of us. The whole time."

"Don't tell anyone, babe," she said. "It's very bad for business."

The motion light didn't come on for her.

(if: $naomiCame)[You took out your phone and sent the hardest text of the week to both of them, even though they were ten feet away through a door.](else:)[You took out your phone and sent the hardest text of the week to both of them. Iris, ten feet away through a door. Naomi, across campus, awake.]

<span class="phone me">im not okay either. can we talk about it tomorrow</span>
<span class="phone">obviously. idiot. (if: $naomiCame)[get back in here](else:)[im coming over. right now]</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">Naomi</span>

[[The end->Credits]]


:: End Middle [bg-gallery day]
<div class="dayhead">A MONTH LATER</div>
Everyone makes it to the end of the week. That's the most important thing, and you know it. You tell yourself that a lot.

Iris gets help. She doesn't ask you to come with her. (if: $leaks > 0)[She found out what you did from someone who wasn't you, and she never says anything about it.] She just stops answering, slowly, until she doesn't answer at all.

Naomi switches to a different library. You see her across the quad sometimes. Once she lifts her hand like she's going to wave, then puts it in her pocket instead.

You're all alive. You walk past each other on campus. It's quiet, and it's sad, and it's so much better than the rain.

<span class="phone">Huh. Close one, babe.</span> &nbsp;<span class="quiet">unknown number</span>

[[The end->Credits]]


:: End Bad [bg-black rain]
It rains on the day of the funeral. Just like last time.

(if: $iris < 35)[Iris goes first, on the last night, at the same minute as before. Her mother is at the front again. You know exactly where she'll reach for the edge of the casket. She does.

Naomi stops eating after that. Stops answering. She believed it was her sentence that did it, and nobody was there to tell her it wasn't. Three weeks later there's a second row of white flowers.

You stand at the back of both. You know what you did, all of it, and you never told anyone how it felt. Nobody knows to check on you, because you made sure nobody knew anything.

That night your room is very quiet. Your phone is face down. You don't answer it.](else:)[It's Naomi this time. The one who said she didn't care. The one who always brought two coffees. She went on the last night, alone, believing all of it was hers.

Iris stands at the back with you, shaking. (if: $confessedIris)[She doesn't look at you. She knows whose sentence it really was.](else:)[She holds your sleeve. She doesn't know whose sentence it really was. You never told her.]

You know what you did, all of it, and you never told anyone how it felt. That night your room is very quiet. Your phone is face down. You don't answer it.

Across campus, the light in Iris's window stays on all night. And then, a few nights later, it doesn't.]

Maeve is sitting on the end of your bed, swinging her legs.

"Oh, babe," she says, very softly. "I didn't want any of you. Not one." She touches your hair with her cold hand. "You were never supposed to carry it alone."

The page goes dark.

[[...->Credits]]


:: End She Waits [bg-room-mc night maeve]
On the last night Maeve is sitting on your bed. She's been your girlfriend for four days. She's been Death for a lot longer.

"You did the hard thing," she says. "Holding on to them, with me dragging on your arm the whole time." She kisses your forehead. Her lips are cold. "Not now. I'm really patient, babe. I'm literally the most patient person you'll ever meet."

<div class="dayhead">SIXTY YEARS LATER</div>
You're very old, in a bed, in a room full of people. One of Iris's grandkids is reading in the corner. Naomi, white-haired and still bossy, is telling a nurse she's doing it wrong.

The door opens. Maeve walks in, looking exactly the same.

"Hi, babe," she says. "Told you."

[[The end->Credits]]


:: End All Three [bg-black night maeve]
The week went soft and warm and blurry. Maeve was always there. She was so easy to be with. She never asked for anything.

Iris stopped texting. Naomi stopped texting. You didn't notice when.

On the last night Maeve holds out her hand.

"Come on," she says, gently. "Everyone's already there."

The page goes black. There's nothing after this.

[[...->Credits]]


:: Credits [bg-black]
<div class="logo small" role="img" aria-label="De Mortuis"></div>
<div class="subtitle">nil nisi bonum</div>

<p class="center">A game by Anish Goel.</p>

<p class="center quiet">If this story touched something real for you, you don't have to carry it alone. In the US, call or text 988 to reach the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline, any time.</p>

<p class="center">(link: "Play again")[(restart:)]</p>
