:: D4 Afternoon Iris 2 [bg-stairwell day iris]
(if: $r is "again")[She lets you take it. She doesn't believe you.

But she holds the handrail and keeps climbing, and that's something.](else:)["Report it to who?" she says. "The department that told Hale to stop talking to me?"

She folds the paper into her pocket and takes the rest of the stairs alone.]

