:: D4 Afternoon Naomi [bg-stairwell day naomi]
Naomi is ripping the printouts off the wall like they owe her money. She has a stack of them under her arm. Her hands are shaking.

"Somebody has to," she says. "Everyone walks past. Everyone just //walks past//."

She tears one in half. It doesn't help.

(link-reveal-goto: "Take the other side of the stairwell. Rip faster.", "D4 Afternoon Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it + 5, $r to "rip")]
(link-reveal-goto: "\"Hey. Slow down. Breathe.\"", "D4 Afternoon Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it - 5, $r to "slow")]


:: D4 Afternoon Naomi 2 [bg-stairwell day naomi]
(if: $r is "rip")[It takes ten minutes. At the bottom she drops the whole stack into the recycling and stands there looking at it.

"It's not enough," she says. "It's never going to be enough."

It sounds like a confession. You don't know yet what she's confessing to.](else:)["Don't tell me to breathe." She rips the next one so hard the tape takes paint with it. "I'm breathing. Look at me breathing."

She doesn't look at you once after that.]

[[Keep going->D4 Late]]


:: D4 Late [bg-hall-brick day hub]
Late afternoon. You have a missed call from your mom. You text back //all good//, like you always do. It isn't. You're not sure when that started.

(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devI >= $devN, "Find Iris. She was quiet at lunch.", "Iris went quiet at lunch. Find her."), "D4 Late Iris")[(display: "pick iris")]
