:: D4 Late Naomi [bg-cafe day naomi]
Naomi is behind the counter of the café, covering someone's shift. She's very good at it. She is also, you notice, crying a little while she steams the milk, and nobody else notices.

"Don't," she says, when she sees your face. "It's the steam."

(set: $mtFrom to "iris")(display: "midtext")
