:: D4 Late Naomi 2 [bg-cafe day naomi]
(if: $r is "order")[You order the most annoying drink on the menu. She makes it perfectly, with a tiny lopsided heart in the foam, and slides it over without charging you.

"Don't read into the heart," she says. "It's just foam."](else:)["It's the steam," she says again, louder. Someone in the queue looks over.

She turns her back on you to make the next drink.]

[[Keep going->D4 Night]]


