:: D5 Late Iris [bg-gallery night iris]
The opening is in the long art hallway, lit teal and orange, full of people holding plastic cups. Iris almost turns around at the door. She doesn't.

Someone from her studio class waves at her. Just waves. Like it's normal.

(set: $mtFrom to "naomi")(display: "midtext")
