(if: $r is "stay")[One drink becomes two. Iris talks to the girl from studio about charcoal for ten whole minutes.

On the way out she grabs your arm and whispers, "She didn't say anything. She didn't say //anything//," like it's a miracle. It kind of is.](else:)[She lets you steer her out. In the hallway she says, "You're right. It's better if they don't see me."

That isn't what you meant. It's too late to say so.]

