:: D5 Late Naomi [bg-room-naomi night naomi]
Naomi's room is dark except for her laptop. She's written something. She turns the screen toward you without a word.

It's a post. A long one. //I'm the one who told people about Iris's money stuff. I'm sorry. None of the rest is true.// Her cursor is sitting on //Post//.

(set: $mtFrom to "iris")(display: "midtext")
