:: D5 Late Naomi 2 [bg-room-naomi night naomi]
(if: $r is "close")[She lets you. She puts her face in her hands and says, through them, "I just want it to be my fault in a way I can fix."

Something itches at the back of your mind, like a word on the tip of your tongue. You can't reach it. Not yet.](else:)[She posts it. Within ten minutes it has two hundred comments. Within twenty, some of them are about her.

She reads every single one.]

