:: D6 Late Naomi [bg-room-naomi night naomi]
(if: $confessedNaomi)[Naomi is painting her nails black on the floor. "Hold still," she says, and paints yours too, without asking. "Solidarity. We're both idiots."

(link-reveal-goto: "Let her. Badly.", "D6 Late Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it + 5, $r to "good")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Tell her black isn't your colour.", "D6 Late Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it - 5, $r to "bad")]](else:)[Naomi is on the floor in the dark. She doesn't turn the light on when you come in.

"I keep thinking about her," she says. "Iris. Like, what she's thinking about. Tonight." She hugs her knees. "What if I made it so bad that she..."

She doesn't finish.

(link-reveal-goto: "Sit next to her in the dark. Tell her you'll be with Iris tomorrow night.", "D6 Late Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it + 5, $r to "good")]
