:: D6 Late Naomi 2 [bg-room-naomi night naomi]
(if: $confessedNaomi)[(if: $r is "good")[Your nails look terrible. She takes a picture and makes it her lock screen "as evidence." She laughs again. Twice in one day.](else:)["Everything's your colour," she says, offended, and paints them anyway. But she goes quiet after.]](else:)[(if: $r is "good")["Tomorrow," she says. "Okay. Text me. Text me the second anything's weird." She grabs your sleeve. "Promise."

