:: D7 Choice [bg-hall-posters day hub]
The last afternoon. A few hours until it gets dark. You can't split yourself between them. You've tried all week.

(if: $iris < $naomi)[Iris has been quiet all day. Quieter than Monday.](else-if: $naomi < $iris)[Naomi has gone quiet again. You know what that means now.](else:)[They both look tired. Everyone does.]

(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devI >= $devN, "Spend the rest of the day with Iris.", "Spend the rest of the day with Iris. It's late, but it isn't too late."), "D7 With Iris")[(set: $devI to it + 1, $last to "iris", $iris to it + 20, $baseI to it + 20, $naomi to it - 5)(display: "clamp")]
(link-reveal-goto: (cond: $devN >= $devI, "Spend the rest of the day with Naomi.", "Spend the rest of the day with Naomi. Even if she doesn't want you there."), "D7 With Naomi")[(set: $devN to it + 1, $last to "naomi", $naomi to it + 20, $baseN to it + 20, $iris to it - 5)(display: "clamp")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Spend it alone. You need to think.", "Alone")[(set: $next to "D7 Evening")(display: "go alone")]


:: D7 With Iris [bg-room-iris-clean day iris]
(if: $lockI)[Iris lets you in, but she doesn't look at you.

"You're here now," she says. "Today. After all week."

You try to say something. She shakes her head.

"Everyone gets nice right at the end. It's so fake." She puts her headphones on. "You're so fake."

You stay anyway. It doesn't matter. You can feel that it doesn't matter.](else:)[You stay. You don't leave her alone for one minute. You make bad tea. You put on something with too many episodes. Every time she gets up, you notice where she goes.

Around six she says, "You're being weird."

"Yeah."

"Okay," she says. "Stay weird." She puts her feet in your lap.]

[[Evening->D7 Evening]]


:: D7 With Naomi [bg-library day naomi]
(if: $lockN)["Oh, //now// you want to hang out," Naomi says. "Wow. Sunday. Great timing."

You sit down anyway.

"You picked her all week. Don't do the thing where you pretend." She shoves her books into her bag. "It's fake. You're being fake."

She leaves. You sit at her table alone until it gets dark.](else-if: $hidNaomi)[Naomi doesn't want you there. You stay anyway, at the next table, until she gives up.

"You're so annoying," she says, finally sitting with you. It's the first thing she's said to you all day. It's not nothing.](else:)[You spend the whole afternoon at Naomi's table. She does none of her work. She steals your pen, then your hoodie, then your fries.

Around five she says, out of nowhere, "I'm glad it's you. My friend, I mean. You know?" Then she pretends she didn't say it.]

(unless: $lockN)[When it gets dark, she pushes you toward the door.

"Go see Iris," she says. "Now. Go."]

[[Evening->D7 Evening]]


