:: D2 Evening [bg-room-iris night iris]
Iris texts after dinner. <span class="phone">can you come over. dont have to talk</span>

(if: $last is "naomi")[You've barely seen her today. You go anyway.](else:)[You only left her an hour ago. You go back.]

You end up on her floor. Bad tea. A movie neither of you is watching.

While she's in the bathroom her phone lights up on the carpet next to you. You don't mean to look.

<span class="phone">Mom: missed call (3)</span>

When she comes back she sees you looking. She stands very still in the doorway. Then she sits down next to you, and for a long time she just holds the phone.

"She's sick," Iris says. "My mom. Since spring. I've been driving home every weekend. That's why my grades... that's why. Hale knew. He was the only one who knew. He was helping me with the extension forms."

She laughs, and it isn't a laugh. "That's the whole scandal. Extension forms."

You've been here before. Last time she told you about the scholarship on this same floor, and you said //that sucks// and asked if she wanted pizza.

(if: $switches > 0)[(link: "▸ see what she's thinking")[(set: $switches to it - 1, $hauntIris to true)<span class="thought iris">//Please don't say sorry like everyone says sorry.// //Please don't look at me like that.// She's bracing for it. //he's the only one who doesn't look at me like that.//</span>]]

(link-reveal-goto: "Ask her if she wants people to know. It's hers to decide.", "D2 Reaction")[(set: $react to "hers", $irisTold to true, $iris to it + 20, $baseI to it + 20)(display: "clamp")]
(link-reveal-goto: "Tell her you'll post the truth tonight. Everyone should know.", "D2 Reaction")[(set: $react to "post", $irisTold to true, $iris to it - 15)(display: "clamp")]
(link-reveal-goto: "\"That sucks.\" Ask if she wants pizza.", "D2 Reaction")[(set: $react to "pizza", $irisTold to true, $iris to it - 25)(display: "clamp")]


:: D2 Reaction [bg-room-iris night iris]
(if: $react is "hers")[She looks at you like she's waiting for the catch. There isn't one.

"Not yet," she says finally. "Maybe not ever. Is that okay?"

"It's yours."

She puts her head on your knee, just for a second. "Thank you for asking," she says. "Nobody asks."](else-if: $react is "post")["No." It comes out sharp. "No, please. Then it's everyone's again. Then it's my //mom// they're talking about."

She takes her phone back and holds it against her chest, like you might take that too.

"Please don't," she says. You promise you won't. She doesn't look like she believes you.](else:)[The words are out before you can stop them. The exact same words.

Iris blinks. "Yeah," she says. "It does suck." A pause. "Sure. Pizza."

You order it. You eat it. She doesn't say anything else about her mom. Not tonight. Not ever, maybe.

Somewhere a long way down, you hear the rain.]

[[Head home->D2 Night]]


:: D3 Evening Iris [bg-room-iris night iris]
Iris has her window open even though it's cold. She's drawing, actually drawing, with the pencil moving.

Her phone buzzes. //Mom.// She picks up this time, and she doesn't leave the room to do it.

"Yeah, Mom. I'm okay. My friend's here." A pause. "No, a real one."

After, she says, "I don't usually let anyone hear me talk to her. I sound like a little kid."

(link-reveal-goto: "\"You sound like someone who loves her mom.\"", "D3 Evening Iris 2")[(set: $iris to it + 5, $r to "loves")]
(link-reveal-goto: "\"You kind of did.\"", "D3 Evening Iris 2")[(set: $iris to it - 5, $r to "kid")]


:: D3 Evening Iris 2 [bg-room-iris night iris]
(if: $r is "loves")[She throws a pillow at you, but she's smiling.

She lets you pick the next movie. Nobody has let you pick the movie in years.](else:)[She laughs. But she puts the phone face down after that, and she doesn't pick it up again.]

[[Head out->D3 Night]]


:: D3 Evening Naomi [bg-room-naomi night naomi]
The laundry room in Naomi's building is hot and smells like dryer sheets. Naomi is folding the same shirt over and over.

"Someone posted that Iris was crying in Hale's office last spring," she says. "Like that proves anything." She folds the shirt again. "She was probably crying about something real. People cry about real things."

(link-reveal-goto: "\"Yeah. People do.\"", "D3 Evening Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it + 5, $r to "real")]
(link-reveal-goto: "\"How would you know?\"", "D3 Evening Naomi 2")[(set: $naomi to it - 5, $r to "how")]


:: D3 Evening Naomi 2 [bg-room-naomi night naomi]
(if: $r is "real")[She nods. She finally puts the shirt down.

"Help me with the sheets," she says. "They're impossible. Like my life." It's almost a joke. You take two corners.](else:)["I don't //know//. I'm just saying."

She shoves everything into the basket, unfolded, and leaves.]

[[Head out->D3 Night]]


